{"3027300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Radiation Hazard", "steam_appid": 3027300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are tasked with transporting creatures via a metal cart on wheels. Your transport zone is deep underground in caves hidden from society to perform irradiated experiments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027300/extras/743055b400a7a12d327e1b3fd618101d.poster.avif?t=1783984597\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027300/extras/743055b400a7a12d327e1b3fd618101d.webm?t=1783984597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027300/extras/743055b400a7a12d327e1b3fd618101d.mp4?t=1783984597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the cave and survive by finding items that will aid your success and prevent an undesirable end.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Horror Multiplayer Survival </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Physics Based Cart Transportation</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Procedural Generation</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Creatures that lurk within</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027300/extras/f8c808b404b7b3108a8410e0f7ebf791.poster.avif?t=1783984597\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/